  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato, carrot and capsicum into bite-sized chunks. Slice red onion into thick wedges.\n• Spread prepped veggies across two lined oven trays. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with garlic & herb seasoning and season with salt and pepper.\n• Toss veggies to coat, then bake until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62a03a73d1ec4f68c30835ca/step-6907229c.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop walnuts. Set aside.\n• Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• When the veggies have 5 minutes remaining, heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Reduce heat to medium. Add the honey and mixed sesame seeds and cook, turning haloumi, until fragrant and coated, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62a03a73d1ec4f68c30835ca/step-9116f4fd.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the roasted veggie trays, add baby spinach leaves and a drizzle of red wine vinegar and olive oil.\n• Gently toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62a03a73d1ec4f68c30835ca/step-96b1bada.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Roughly chop parsley leaves.\n• Divide roast veggie toss between plates. Top with honey and sesame haloumi.\n• Sprinkle with walnuts and parsley to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62a03a73d1ec4f68c30835ca/step-78631fc8.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
